# graft's code graph. A local cache: regenerate with `graft build`, never commit it.
/graft/
# .ignore is a ripgrep SEARCH preference, not an ignore rule. graft writes it so its
# generated cards stay greppable locally. The directory it points at is per-machine and
# will not exist on another laptop until they run `graft build` themselves, so it must
# never be shared.
.ignore
.factory/
